      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "76. 余弦函数、正切函数和余切函数的导函数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在这一小节里，我们利用正弦函数的导函数（第75小节）",
        "计算余弦函数、正切函数和余切函数的导函数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\cos' x=-\\sin x$， (1)",
        "$\\operatorname{tg}' x=\\frac{1}{\\cos^2x}$， (2)",
        "$\\operatorname{ctg}' x=-\\frac{1}{\\sin^2x}$. (3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "上列公式中的每一个式子在对应函数定义域内任何一点",
        "都成立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了推出(1)式，我们利用等式$\\cos x=\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x\\right)$和复",
        "合函数微分法则：",
        "$\\cos' x=\\left[\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x\\right)\\right]'=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x\\right)'↵=\\sin x(-1)=-\\sin x$."
      ]
    },
